   "install": {
    "title": "Installation",
    "html": "<p>We recommend adding FastMCP to your project with <a href=\"https://docs.astral.sh/uv/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">uv</a>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">uv add fastmcp\n</code></pre>\n<p>For full installation instructions, including verification and upgrading, see the <a href=\"https://gofastmcp.com/getting-started/installation\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Installation Guide</strong></a>.</p>\n<p><strong>Upgrading?</strong> We have guides for:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://gofastmcp.com/getting-started/upgrading/from-fastmcp-3\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Upgrading from FastMCP 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://gofastmcp.com/getting-started/upgrading/from-fastmcp-2\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Upgrading from FastMCP 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://gofastmcp.com/getting-started/upgrading/from-mcp-sdk-v1\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Upgrading from MCP SDK v1</a> or <a href=\"https://gofastmcp.com/getting-started/upgrading/from-mcp-sdk-v2\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">v2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://gofastmcp.com/getting-started/upgrading/from-low-level-sdk-v1\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Upgrading from the low-level SDK v1</a> or <a href=\"https://gofastmcp.com/getting-started/upgrading/from-low-level-sdk-v2\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">v2</a></li>\n</ul>",
